/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (On the day in question everything happened after the SvS against 90. The fight was over 5 hours were we lost due to people running out of troops/tired/ gave up. There was finger pointing and bickering in both Nap discord, in game nap chat, R4 chat RLHN, world chat, and event chat. That's when Adame and Aeyd both left RLHN for M&M. Rose warned Gorgie aka King princess that she was going to burn Adame for stabbing her in the back for a 3rd time in about a month. Gorgie said no. So Rose tossed r5 of RLHN to Rotor and left. She called me to come over she was about to burn Adame. When I got to her place she was in the process of burning Adame. When she finished burning him she sat her phone down and said I'm done. I quit. I asked if she was sure and she said YES! So I picked up her phone and zeroed Gorgie, Adame, and Creed. Creed was more so for abusing the women in nap chat/discord. I hit Hoop once for trying to reinforce Gorgie. They then decided they wanted to hit me on Dark Rose and I turtled up. Then some how someone guessed it was me on Rose and said something in world chat. Next thing you know I look at my phone and see Lucifer's Wife aka Cyborg Luci was screaming in RLHN chat that I need to be kicked out of the alliance. So I left the alliance due to only Rotor being able to kick me since I was an r4 at the time. As much as people want to think it was Rose burning people she just burned Adame once. I zeroed him, Creed, and Gorgie. I never denied it nor did I apologize for it.)
/E (On the day in question everything happened after the SvS against 90. The fight was over 5 hours were we lost due to people running out of troops/tired/ gave up. There was finger pointing and bickering in both Nap discord, in game nap chat, R4 chat RLHN, world chat, and event chat. That's when Adame and Aeyd both left RLHN for M&M. Rose warned Gorgie aka King princess that she was going to burn Adame for stabbing her in the back for a 3rd time in about a month. Gorgie said no. So Rose tossed r5 of RLHN to Rotor and left. She called me to come over she was about to burn Adame. When I got to her place she was in the process of burning Adame. When she finished burning him she sat her phone down and said I'm done. I quit. I asked if she was sure and she said YES! So I picked up her phone and zeroed Gorgie, Adame, and Creed. Creed was more so for abusing the women in nap chat/discord. I hit Hoop once for trying to reinforce Gorgie. They then decided they wanted to hit me on Dark Rose and I turtled up. Then some how someone guessed it was me on Rose and said something in world chat. Next thing you know I look at my phone and see Lucifer's Wife aka Cyborg Luci was screaming in RLHN chat that I need to be kicked out of the alliance. So I left the alliance due to only Rotor being able to kick me since I was an r4 at the time. As much as people want to think it was Rose burning people she just burned Adame once. I zeroed him, Creed, and Gorgie. I never denied it nor did I apologize for it.)
